OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's birth rate falls to
OL,4,Arecord low for third year running
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of babies born in Scotland
OL,7,Ffell to a record low for the third
OL,8,Fconsecutive year, new figures show.
OL,10,FData published by the National Records
OL,11,Fof Scotland (NRS) shows there were
OL,12,F45,067 live births registered in 2025,
OL,13,Falmost 696 fewer than the year before
OL,14,Fand the lowest annual total since
OL,15,Frecords began in 1855.
OL,17,FFor the 11th consecutive year deaths
OL,18,Falso continue to outnumber births
OL,19,Facross the country. The gap between
OL,20,Fdeaths and births has generally widened
OL,21,Fsince 2014.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
