OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's birth rate falls to
OL,4,Arecord low for third year running
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NRS said the figures will "inform
OL,7,Fdebate and decision-making" across the
OL,8,Fpublic and private sectors as the
OL,9,Fmakeup of the country changes.
